\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Riches unsearchable
\par In Jesu's love we know;
\par And pleasures, springing from the well
\par Of life, our souls o'erflow.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The Spirit we receive
\par Of wisdom, grace, and power;
\par And always sorrowful we live,
\par Rejoicing evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Angels our servants are,
\par And keep in all our ways,
\par And in their watchful hands they bear
\par The sacred sons of grace:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Unto that heavenly bliss
\par They all our steps attend;
\par And God Himself our Father is,
\par And Jesus is our Friend.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

